        },
        {
          "step": "3",
          "title": "Aggregate!",
          "text": "3. Aggregate!\r\nStochastic Aggregation builds an aggregation by randomly selecting one part\r\nand one rule to be applied at every step. The component adds parts additively \r\nover the already aggregated parts. If a new aggregation has to be created,\r\nthe RESET button allows to reset the aggregation and restart.",
