        },
        {
          "step": "5",
          "title": "Replace Geometry",
          "text": "5. Replace Geometry\r\nUsing the TR output from the DePart component,\r\nit is possible to replace the basic geometry of\r\nthe part with a different geometry (e.g. higher level\r\nof detail) without slowing down the aggregation process.\r\nThe MASK output of the NameFilter component provides\r\na boolean pattern to separate different part types.",
